  "summary": "War between Russia and Japan, 1904–1905, after years of dispute over control of Manchuria. It opened with a Japanese attack on the Russian fleet at Port Arthur and included the costly battle of Mukden. The Treaty of Portsmouth, signed on 5 September 1905 with US mediation, gave Japan control in Korea and southern Sakhalin.",
